{
  "bookId": "rewind-9",
  "id": "source-4607",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "4607001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "洛瑞丝",
          "text": "真是遗憾，看来今天是不能请您到府上了。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4607002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "洛瑞丝",
          "text": "不过相信我们很快就能在M城见面。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4607003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "真是奇怪的人。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4607004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "明智光秀",
          "text": "我的难题已经解决了，我准备现在出发赶到M城。\n绿子、蓝莎最好尽快离开这里，对方看上去是个难缠的人。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4607005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "明智光秀",
          "text": "听你们所言，似乎还没有落脚的地方，不嫌弃的话，可以到我朋友府上暂住一段时间，或者长住，相信有钱的他不会介意的。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4607006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "太棒了！我们也在苦恼住所的问题。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4607007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蓝莎·海恩",
          "text": "谢谢，不同路。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4607008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "可是……好吧。那谢谢你热情的大叔。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4607009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "明智光秀",
          "text": "大……大叔！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4607010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "明智光秀",
          "text": "要叫哥哥。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4607011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "他走了，我们还要去M城吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4607012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蓝莎·海恩",
          "text": "可有想去的地方？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4607013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "（激动）太棒了！太棒了！那个，我们组团一起环游世界吧？一定超酷的！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4607014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蓝莎·海恩",
          "text": "……不了，我们就在这附近。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4607015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "绿子",
          "text": "这附近没什么好看的，而且有蛇~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "4607016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "蓝莎·海恩",
          "text": "嗯。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
